 {"id":"2c1cbeae-fecd-455c-860e-1191d0fd02ad","course":null,"segment":null,"area":"safety","key":"scan.healthy","value_en":"Network, browser, storage and screen are all healthy. Your payment can proceed.","value_ta":"இணையம், உலாவி, சேமிப்பு மற்றும் திரை அனைத்தும் சரியாக உள்ளன. கட்டணம் தொடரலாம்.","meta":null,"sort_order":14,"active":true,"status":"published","created_at":"2026-07-03T20:48:42.042427+00:00","updated_at":"2026-07-03T20:48:42.042427+00:00","translations":{}}, 
